<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK</div>
    <h1>Proof, Not Just Promise</h1>
    <p class="lede">These projects reflect my focus on making information more accessible, strengthening digital confidence and creating practical opportunities for civic participation.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="work-item reveal">
      <div class="work-media"><img src="/images/prashasan-pro-pitch-event.jpg" alt="Sujina Dahal receiving a participation certificate at a business-idea event"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="role">Founder</div>
        <h3>Prashasan Pro — Civic Technology for Easier Public Services</h3>
        <p>A civic-technology startup focused on making citizenship, passport and related administrative procedures easier, faster and more reliable through clear, accessible information. Website launched; mobile app in development.</p>
        <div class="structure">Objective → citizen problem → solution → current status → future roadmap → screenshots → expected public impact.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="work-item reveal">
      <div class="work-media"><img src="/images/digital-literacy-workshop.jpg" alt="Young participants writing notes during a training session"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="role">Digital Literacy Trainer · 2,000+ students trained</div>
        <h3>Digital Literacy and AI Safety Training</h3>
        <p>A training initiative delivered through Pokhara Youth Council to help students understand AI, online safety, digital footprints, misinformation and disinformation.</p>
        <div class="structure">Need → curriculum → delivery method → participants → learning outcomes → photos/feedback.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="work-item reveal">
      <div class="work-media"><img src="/images/rotaract-district-conference-2.jpg" alt="Sujina Dahal at a district-level conference"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="role">Provincial Coordinator &amp; SDG Advocacy Volunteer</div>
        <h3>UN SDG Outreach — Gandaki Province</h3>
        <p>A multi-district initiative supporting SDG awareness, community engagement and monitoring across Gandaki Province — 11 districts reached, with compiled M&amp;E data.</p>
        <div class="structure">Objective → districts reached → stakeholders → reporting process → community stories → outcomes.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="work-item reveal">
      <div class="work-media"><img src="/images/eimun-laptop-session.jpg" alt="Sujina Dahal at a conference table with research materials"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="role">Researcher · 250+ respondents</div>
        <h3>Independent Research: E-Gadget Buying Behaviour</h3>
        <p>An individual research project examining how brand popularity, price, features and social influence affect college students' buying behaviour, using correlation, regression, ANOVA and t-tests.</p>
        <div class="structure">Research question → methodology → variables → findings → limitations → policy/business relevance.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="work-item reveal">
      <div class="work-media"><img src="/images/liberty-camp-session-2.jpg" alt="Sujina Dahal speaking at a Liberty Camp youth programme"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="role">Youth Leadership &amp; Programme Coordination</div>
        <h3>Youth Leadership and Civic Engagement</h3>
        <p>Leadership through the US Embassy Youth Council, Rotaract, MUN, YSALI selection and community initiatives — spanning training, public relations and service-project roles.</p>
        <div class="structure">Role, year, activity, contribution and measurable result for each initiative.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
